ell-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, July to August is the driest pair in Bell County at 4.01 inches normal, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids it came in under 90% of normal in 38 of the 75 years in the record. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 177% of normal in June to July and 46% in November to December. Grid 13030 had its driest year in 1954, at 38% of normal.</p>"}
